{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果據稱已要求供應鏈提高首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo的生產目標，將首個12個月的產量規劃從970萬部上調至1400萬部，增幅約為44%。這一調整被認為與產品預購需求強勁有關，但由於摺疊屏、鉸鏈及組裝環節仍存在製造挑戰，訂單增加並不意味着最終實際產量一定能夠同步增長。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583442.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T22:19:07.562114+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:16:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:17:50.158045+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:17:50.158045+00:00","content_hash":"3700ff86dcf452794794157e0a3ba65e08a2358372d9124c490c69725cfc2b4c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}